Only definitions and proofs needed for preparation and analytic division
are retained.
The coefficient field is changed from complex to real. Norm identities are
adapted to real scalars and sequence summability proofs made explicit where
needed. The files are split into the Transformer.AnalyticPreparation namespace.
Mathlib 4.34 adaptations replace Finset.prod_le_one by prod_le_one₀ and
 deprecated dif_pos/dif_neg by dite_eq_left/dite_eq_right.
The finite-variable division adapter and its function-germ uniqueness are
adapted from LocalComplexGeometry; see its NOTICE. Unrelated generic
product-indexed interfaces and preparation uniqueness are omitted.
